            The utilisation sweep — the most useful table here
          </h2>
          <p class="mt-4 text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
            Same ${base.wage} wage, same burden, same overhead, same margin. Only the hours you manage to sell
            change. Computed from the same code the calculator runs.
          </p>

          <div class="mt-8 overflow-x-auto rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white shadow-sm">
